sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant R as Receiver
  participant O as Observer
  S->>R: dependent event before prerequisite
  R-->>S: accepted/staged/rejected by declared contract
  S->>O: checkpoint: no corrupt partial state
  O-->>S: normalized evidence
  S->>R: prerequisite event
  R-->>S: response
  S->>O: eventual final state
  O-->>S: allowed terminal state
